    "description": "<p>Performing a quick series of motions that offer thanks and claim guidance from the earth, sky and sea, with the martial artist herself representing fire and life, the Dragon-Blood takes aspects of all five elements into her technique. Her unarmed Martial Arts attacks inflict lethal damage instead of bashing, and she soaks lethal damage with her full bashing soak. If she's wielding one of the form's weapons, she treats it as though it has +1 Accuracy. Also, she adds her Essence to her Dexterity or Strength for determining running speed, jumping distance and feats of strength.</p>",
